{"id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-peano-arithmetic.md","title":"Peano Arithmetic","display":"df-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","aliases":["89-df-peano-arithmetic","PA","Peano arithmetic"],"display":"df-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[58-df-arithmetic]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-proof-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-peano-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-peano-arithmetic</span><span>PA</span><span>Peano arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c112e121aec5c9ff\" href=\"?note=c112e121aec5c9ff\" title=\"58-df-arithmetic\">58-df-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d63c357151e48e9d\" href=\"?note=d63c357151e48e9d\" title=\"58-df-proof-system\">58-df-proof-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}=\\{0,S,+,\\times,=\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}=\\{0,S,+,\\times,=\\}\\)</span> is the first-order\nlanguage of arithmetic, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> is its set\nof sentences.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span> denotes capture-avoiding substitution, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\">\\(\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\\)</span> ranges over formulas whose displayed variables\ninclude all free variables, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bar y\">\\(x\\notin\\bar y\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\n\\forall x\\;Sx\\ne0,\n\\ \\forall x\\forall y\\;(Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x+0=x),\n\\ \\forall x\\forall y\\;(x+Sy=S(x+y)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x\\times0=0),\n\\ \\forall x\\forall y\\;(x\\times Sy=x\\times y+x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\n\\forall\\bar y\\,\\bigl((\\varphi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x\\,(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[Sx/x]))\n\\to\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\mid \\varphi=\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\n\\forall x\\;Sx\\ne0,\n\\ \\forall x\\forall y\\;(Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x+0=x),\n\\ \\forall x\\forall y\\;(x+Sy=S(x+y)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x\\times0=0),\n\\ \\forall x\\forall y\\;(x\\times Sy=x\\times y+x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\n\\forall\\bar y\\,\\bigl((\\varphi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x\\,(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[Sx/x]))\n\\to\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\mid \\varphi=\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> is the first-order theory of arithmetic used as the target theory for arithmetical interpretations.</li>\n<li>The background coding and proof-theoretic infrastructure is inherited from Book 58 via the frontmatter dependencies.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"c112e121aec5c9ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d63c357151e48e9d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-proof-system]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}=\\{0,S,+,\\times,=\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x,\\bar y)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\bar y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&\n\\forall x\\;Sx\\ne0,\n\\ \\forall x\\forall y\\;(Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\;(x+0=x),\n\\ \\forall x\\forall y\\;(x+Sy=S(x+y)),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\;(x\\times0=0),\n\\ \\forall x\\forall y\\;(x\\times Sy=x\\times y+x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&\n\\forall\\bar y\\,\\bigl((\\varphi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x\\,(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[Sx/x]))\n\\to\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\mid \\varphi=\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}&\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false}],"bytes":1637,"backlinks":[{"id":"89cc8db92b5fad14","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"646431d492b9ae8a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8c9363f0c1d91236","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ (see [[89-df-peano-arithmetic]])."},{"id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"95d5a7c3d486f284","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ (see [[89-df-peano-arithmetic]])."},{"id":"b2b62c1bcece60ed","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"97b68cd750e79cac","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1cc7f2e21119da30","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"02523cf5c9863d04","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5994c5401e3dcdfd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8220f4203bbba1d2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e5cb4b74acf0f7a9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"789ec4567d4c52bd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ab8391d7623da45d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"be68cce492414c6b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"